{room, key=cult_inner_sanctum, name=Inner Sanctum
    {attrib, output=false, tags=tested }

    {enter_message
        output={@
Red dots of light glow in a grid pattern over the single curved wall that
surrounds you. In the center of the room, hovering just below the ceiling,
is a large chrome ring. Every now and then it flickers a dim red.

Along the wall are high-back chairs. Five of them are occupied by hooded
figures sitting motionless.

The figure with the neon antlers turns to face you. Then stands motionless.

        }

        {logic, name=Deepgrid cult inner sanctum tested, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@
You are in what appears to be in inner sanctum.

Red dots of light glow in a grid pattern over the single curved wall that
surrounds you. In the center of the room, hovering just below the ceiling,
is a large chrome ring. Every now and then it flickers a dim red.

Along the wall are high-back chairs. Five of them are occupied by hooded
figures sitting motionless.

The figure with the neon antlers is standing there facing you.

            }
        }
    }


    {inject, logic=/look.inj }

}
